@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+  o Minor features (relay, metrics, onion service directory):
+    - Export onion service descriptor POST outcomes on the MetricsPort as
+      tor_relay_hsdir_post_total with labels for HTTP status ("200" or "400")
+      and reason ("ok", "rev_counter", "bad_url", or "invalid_desc"),
